# Line-ending policy
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scripts executed by POSIX shells MUST be LF. A CRLF checkout turns the shebang
# into "bash\r" and macOS / Linux / Git Bash fail with:
#   env: bash\r: No such file or directory
#
# Intentionally narrow: do NOT add *.json, *.cedar or *.md here. Those files are
# content-pinned by .bap/pins.json and their bytes must not be re-normalised.
*.sh                              text eol=lf
*.bash                            text eol=lf
**/scripts/bap-hook-adapter       text eol=lf
